From 966d500b7a30cb0233990ee3239ad5885cb912ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Janne Grunau <j@jannau.net>
Date: Mon, 25 Dec 2023 18:03:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm: apple: iomfb: export property dicts in connector debugfs

Signed-off-by: Janne Grunau <j@jannau.net>
---
